+## v8 agent + media path
+
+For host integration, use thin discovery rather than copying the corpus. Codex/Antigravity-compatible agents can discover `.agents/skills/nolane-ui/SKILL.md`; Claude Code can discover `.claude/skills/nolane-ui/SKILL.md`; other hosts can call `python scripts/nui-agent-export --agent <id>` or the bounded MCP surface. Always verify current host capability and keep `authority_escalation:false`.
